# Integer addition near the 64-bit limit

Adds 5 to a value just below the signed 64-bit maximum to protect arithmetic
near the supported upper bound.

>>> source
const pos_right: int = 5
const big: int = 9223372036854775800

const big_sum: int = big + pos_right
print(big_sum)

<<< stdout
9223372036854775805

<<< stderr
